      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以赛马娘来说，\n我相信樱花进王拥有优秀的资质，\n足以在任何赛事中获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3736749599ad4a70ecc1a8cfeec95998f7d3f4b3a7fe1fe74a61304c121746d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
