      "uid": "zhcn:7c0ce3cccef716044701ffed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她现在还处于成长阶段也是事实。\n视“春季S”的结果而定，\n可能需要调整她的训练内容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe95eafb6cddfc3859a965ea512f74ac328757b97d0e4d707d45273e305efd22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
