      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我试着告诉她……\n视比赛结果而定，今年我想以短距离为主，\n一步步将她的速度锻炼得出类拔萃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0a2e0b33766827897cd7e4466ba343444f3e9c36171971d6681e92ef0bb4b39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
